{"id":"n48706-1-7","stage":4,"title":"덜하다 · 不够","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48706-1-7-1","ko":"김치가 아직 익지 않았나 봐요?","zh":"泡菜好像还没发酵好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김치가","meaning":"韩国泡菜（辛奇）","explanation":"김치：韩国泡菜（辛奇）；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"김치","audio":"/audio/3c5be729d66a60db4af4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28818","senseId":"1","lemma":"김치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김치가","audio":"/audio/842774ef2738b3022c1b.mp3"}},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}},{"text":"익지","meaning":"熟，发酵","explanation":"익다：熟，发酵；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"익다","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63510","senseId":"3","lemma":"익다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"익지","audio":"/audio/3516ab2b8bf0930665e9.mp3"}},{"text":"않았나","meaning":"不、没有（-지 않다；这里表示还没发酵好）","explanation":"않다：不、没有（-지 않다；这里表示还没发酵好）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았나","audio":"/audio/a889fa4ddda9ecceff5e.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3c5be729d66a60db","term":"김치","zh":"韩国泡菜（辛奇）","audio":"/audio/3c5be729d66a60db4af4.mp3","entr